 or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Quantifiers tell you how much of a thing there is or how many things there are.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use a quantifier before a noun to indicate the amount or number of an item. Quantifiers do not indicate a specific quantity but rather a general amount.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Quantifier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some</br> a lot</br> less</br> a dozen</br> a box</br> a pair</br> a bottle</br> a set</br> a bundle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a general amount</br> a large amount</br> a smaller amount</br> 12</br> a square or rectangular container</br> two</br> the amount inside a bottle</br> a group of two or more</br> a number of things fastened together\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "A lot of us have less money to spend these days.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "One year I got a dozen pairs of funky socks for Christmas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A box of chocolates, a pair of earrings or some  perfume is typical for her.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Past vs Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense to talk about things that are finished. You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about actions that have a connection to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Gift traditions have changed throughout the years. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I haven't chosen jewelry or a tie for anyone lately. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "One year I got a dozen pairs of funky socks for Christmas. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Action is over and has no connection to present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use \u201ced\u201d for regular verbs.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Action happened in the past, but there is some connection to the present, action may still be happening in the present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use \u201chave or has\u201d and past participle of verb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "substitute", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one thing used instead of another", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Gifts have never been a substitute for love.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about gift giving.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "caring", "type": "name"}, {"content": "kind; giving emotional support ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are very caring people. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to choose", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to decide between two or more things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's sometime difficult to choose gifts. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "customary", "type": "name"}, {"content": "usual ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Perfume is a customary gift for women.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cufflinks ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "small items to fasten shirt cuffs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Does he ever wear cufflinks? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "aftershave", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a cologne for men to wear after shaving", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I always bought my father aftershave for Christmas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ecstatic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happy and excited ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was ecstatic when she saw the gift! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bundle of joy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a new baby ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They brought home their bundle of joy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be less important", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Other presents paled in comparison to their new grandson.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le18ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Make a list of 10 gifts you have given in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a note beside each to say why you gave these gifts.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write what the gifts were on small squares of paper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask a partner to turn over a paper and ask who you gave the gift to and why you gave it to them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I make a list of gifts I've given.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write why I have given these gifts.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain to a partner why I have given these gifts.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le18ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le18ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "We give gifts hoping to please the recipient. Gifts have never been a substitute for love or caring. However a carefully chosen gift can show both.</p>Choosing the perfect gift for a celebration has always been difficult. A box of chocolates, a pair of earrings or some  perfume for a woman have generally been customary. A set of cufflinks or a bottle of aftershave for a man were traditional standards for many years."}, {"image": "engenn6le18ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "27000", "id": 2, "text": "One year I got a dozen pairs of funky socks for Christmas. They made my day. My grandparents were ecstatic over the new bundle of joy called Teddy my mother brought home one Christmas Day. Other gifts paled in comparison."}, {"image": "engenn6le18ob06re2img03.jpg", "time": "42000", "id": 3, "text": "Gift traditions have changed throughout the years. I haven't chosen jewelry or a tie for anyone lately. I've given more thoughtful, personal items. These were things I paid little for. Often they were highly cherished.  A lot of us have less money to spend these days. Breaking with established customs seems to be the modern way to go."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about celebrations, customs, and traditions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about general and specific quantities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Talk about two gifts that you have given that were thoughtful but not expensive. ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Did the person like the gift? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Giving is better than receiving!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "i